WEBVTT

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.860
Pick it up, foul wench 
who deceived the prince.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.500
A duel?

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:12.970
It's a duel.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.370
If she picks up the glove, 
it'll mean she accepts the duel.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.270
Pick it up, Marie.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.120
I shall be your champion.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.750
But...

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.880
Okay, everyone. I volunteer 
to be her champion.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.880
You said your name was Leon.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.760
You'd better be ready to face us.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.760
Let's duel, Prince.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.450
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.790
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:10.420
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.000
What is that?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.030
What's with that Armor?

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:33.550
Talk about lame!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.870
Unbelievable!

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.140
Do you really intend to fight with this?

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.510
Just watch.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.340
Why is everyone laughing?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:50.340
You really don't know anything, do you?

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.760
That Armor is most likely a Lost Item.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.460
It can't be replicated 
using modern technology,

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.780
but that doesn't necessarily 
mean it's strong.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:06.390
In modern battles, highly mobile Armor 
emphasizing speed are mainstream.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.470
Such ponderous models are out of style.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.860
But it's kind of cute how 
short and stout it is.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.620
There's something wrong with 
you if you think that's cute.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:23.800
<i>It seems to be more than 
just an ungainly Armor.</i>

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.780
<i>What are you thinking, Bartfort?</i>

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:30.810
Hup.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.340
Activating Arroganz.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.380
All right.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.110
Luxion.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:38.940
What is it?

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.550
What does "Arroganz" mean?

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.610
Look it up later.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.900
It's a word that suits you perfectly, Master.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.850
Oh, yeah? You can actually be 
pretty thoughtful sometimes.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:57.020
Mind If I Go Easy on You?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.810
Looks like you didn't run from our duel.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.720
You deserve props for that.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:08.220
But do you think you can defeat 
me with that outdated machine?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.980
Purple Armor... My first 
opponent must be Brad.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Brad Fou Field

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Combat Power:

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Attack Power:
Defense Power:

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Weapon: Wields a spear (fairly skilled).
 Relationship Score___________________________________

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:21.990
Heir to a margrave. An intelligent adviser-type character. Timid despite being a narcissist. Mentally weak and selfish. 
How dare you call her a foul wench? I'll make you eat your words. 
I demand an apology after this duel.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:17.400
<i>Brad is a narcissist skilled in magic.</i>

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.680
<i>He's the smallest of the five,</i>

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.990
<i>but he's proud and attention-seeking.</i>

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.990
He gave me a lot of trouble in the game.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:29.790
Behold this armor created by 
master craftsman Altenter.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:35.000
It's made with plenty of tetrium, 
which increases its magic conductivity.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:39.500
Should you be bragging at 
such length to your opponent?

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:46.030
He appears to be carrying 
drone-like weapons on his back.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.800
Shall I deploy countermeasures?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.890
Don't worry, I know what it is.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.520
And besides, purple is a weak color.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.400
Your attitude is truly infuriating.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.850
We should ready our own weapons.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:01.400
All right. We'll use Blade 
Number 1 in the backpack.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.710
That's a shovel!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:08.910
Of course it is.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:13.160
When you last took this for 
a test drive, you dug holes.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.830
You should've swapped it back!

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.670
Whatever, just give me a blade!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:20.350
But it was you who designated Blade Number 1.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.670
You totally did this on purpose.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:26.300
Well, fine. I can probably fight with this.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.850
What a back country noble!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.670
A shovel? Seriously?

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:36.560
How disgraceful.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:42.550
How dare you continue to mock me?

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.130
Actually, it's not on purpose.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.580
Champions, state your names before the duel.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.570
Leon Fou Bartfort.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.580
Brad Fou Field.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.710
Ready... Begin!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.960
I'll kill you with a single blow. Die!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:17.530
What?!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.460
Huh?

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.000
Hey, ref. Looks like he's unconscious.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:42.510
I barely grazed him.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:46.510
If you'd attacked at full 
power, he would've died.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:51.260
He was decent with a spear, but that's 
all that was noteworthy about him.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:56.520
Are you sure you're not resentful they 
called Arroganz an outdated model?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.650
H-He's been knocked out.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:02.020
Bartfort wins!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:09.210
I knew this would happen, but no 
one's excited about this outcome.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.030
Huh?

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.750
Master...

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:18.850
Ever the gentleman.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.950
Wh-What?

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.290
What happened?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.920
It happened so fast, I couldn't tell.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:30.740
Mr. Leon won right away. That's impressive.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.550
Uh, yeah.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.550
<i>What were those movements?</i>

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.560
<i>They seem impossible for such 
a heavily armored machine.</i>

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:43.060
<i>Brad's Armor was custom-made 
by the Field family.</i>

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.580
What does this mean?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:45.480
Mr. Brad...

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.670
They'll definitely win the next round, right?

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.060
I bet all my money on the prince.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.920
Wh-What is it, Ms. Angelica?

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.070
How could I not laugh?

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.480
Bartfort is a truly terrible man.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.580
Mr. Leon isn't terrible. He's a kind person.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.460
You're right. He is.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:13.890
<i>Anyway, why did he choose to 
side with me if he's so strong?</i>

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:17.970
<i>He must know defying the 
prince will ruin his future.</i>

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:20.070
Bartfort...

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:23.900
He must've been so confident 
because he had that Armor.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.290
It must be a Lost Item.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:30.510
But I've never heard there were 
such powerful Armors left.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.990
I'm next.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.990
Brad is a weakling.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.060
I'll bring that thing down.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.170
Greg!

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.710
Please!

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.710
You can do it!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.500
It's time for round two.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.880
Greg!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.330
You can do it!

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.500
Get him!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.060
Leon Fou Bartfort.

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:50.750
Greg Fou Seberg.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:55.010
I've identified numerous 
repairs on its surface.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.650
He seems to have plenty of combat 
experience fighting in Armor.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.270
Yeah. He's strong.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.800
Bartfort! You didn't beat 
Brad because you're strong.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:07.270
It's because your Armor is strong!

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.300
You're not wrong, but if you 
want to fight with words,

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.280
could you just invite me 
to a tea party sometime?

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.780
I'll crush you.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.330
Champions, begin!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.120
Come on! What's the matter?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.910
Is that all you've got?

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:34.170
<i>Greg is skilled and determined, but...</i>

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.430
Choose better tools!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:51.690
Greg Fou Seberg

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:51.690
Combat Power:

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:51.690
Attack Power:
Defense Power:

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:51.690
Weapon: Spear (can equip very few items).
 Relationship Score___________________________________

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:51.690
Heir to a count. A talented young man with adventuring experience.
 Looks down on nobles without combat experience. Often fights with Chris.
 This sounds fun. I'm in, too. I'll take on any challengers!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:44.230
<i>Greg is proud because he's skilled,</i>

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:47.500
<i>and there were very few items he could equip.</i>

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:51.170
<i>I had so many game overs because of that.</i>

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:55.940
That Armor you're wearing is an 
outdated mass-produced model!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:10:00.040
Shed that nonsensical pride of yours!

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:04.700
Gotcha.

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:07.030
Let go! Damn it!

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.210
Like hell I'm letting go, moron.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.990
It's all right. The pilot is unaffected.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.720
Your right leg is next.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.660
Do you enjoy tormenting me?

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.720
You're only winning because of your Armor!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:28.250
What? It's your own fault for 
dueling in an outdated Armor.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:32.830
Did you know the outcome of any contest 
is decided during the preparation stage?

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.260
Anyway, aren't you glad 
you got to make excuses?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:44.830
You only lost because my Armor 
is so much better than yours.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.080
Damn it.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.580
Damn it!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.970
I won't lose!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:55.340
I'll fight to the death, even if 
I have to fight without my Armor!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.800
Seriously? But you know...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.340
Shut up! Bring it on!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:06.100
I'm not really a fan of bullying 
the weak, unlike you guys.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.600
What was that?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.100
I'm saying I don't enjoy tormenting 
the weak. Do you understand that?

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:16.610
Don't be absurd! When did 
we ever bully the weak?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:21.110
Wow, it's scary when people have 
so little self-awareness. Gross.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.370
This is why I can't stand nobles 
who receive special treatment.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.470
In any case, you're a nobody.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.610
And tormenting nobodies leaves 
a bad taste in my mouth,

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.580
so I'd like to get this over quickly.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.130
Don't you get that?

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.010
Damn it!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.550
Huh? Did a mosquito land on me?

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:49.560
B-Bartfort wins! Greg Fou Seberg, 
please leave the arena!

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.020
Wow, nasty.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.490
That's not something a knight should do.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:56.060
I can't believe Greg lost, too.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:12:00.790
I'm glad Mr. Leon won, but he went too far.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.220
He should apologize to Mr. Greg later.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.200
Don't.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.970
It would only hurt Greg more.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:11.950
Round three!

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:16.460
Bartfort, I won't underestimate 
you like the other two did.

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:19.080
I'll fight at full strength from the start.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.090
For real?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.050
Then I'll start taking this seriously, too.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.590
You'd better not be lying.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.970
Yeah, I promise.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:40.480
Chris Fia Arclight

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:40.480
Combat Power:

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:40.480
Attack Power:
Defense Power:

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:40.480
Weapon: Swords only.
 Relationship Score_______________

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:40.480
Heir to a count and son of the Sword Saint. He is a skilled swordsman himself and expresses little interest in anything else.
 She saved me by listening to my problems. This is why I wish to protect her.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.120
<i>Chris is a young master swordsman.</i>

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:34.250
<i>He's cold and not very good 
at expressing his emotions.</i>

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.980
<i>He only used swords during the 
combat sections of the game.</i>

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.480
<i>In other words, he's a huge pain in the ass.</i>

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.490
Champions, begin!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.490
What?!

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:51.230
Luxion, deploy the drones.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.020
Yes, Master.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:04.420
Bartfort, you're content to fight like this?

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.680
This is hardly chivalrous!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.180
Is that all you have to say?

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.680
Nobody said shooting was against the rules.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.520
You guys are too weak, anyway. 
I wouldn't mind holding back.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:22.690
I'll allow you to embody 
your precious chivalry.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.890
Bartfort!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:33.450
Truly a master swordsman. Impressive work.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.510
Why? Why did I lose?

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.960
I've worked harder than anyone else.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.950
Why don't you brag to Marie 
about all your hard work?

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.720
She might take pity on you.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.390
You really are a scumbag, aren't you?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:57.100
Shut up. Even I feel like I overdid it a little.

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:58.730
Seriously?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.810
Even Chris?

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:00.840
You're kidding!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.110
But I bet all my money!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:09.490
This isn't good. It's all right if I lose, 
but I must protect the prince.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.150
<i>No matter what it takes.</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:24.710
Hey.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.140
Hey, I have a request.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.530
Did you find him?

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.480
No, nowhere.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.870
Mr. Leon!

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:58.160
We were worried.

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:00.670
Worried? About what?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.070
Your sister we met previously

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:06.370
said you weren't looking well,
so she asked us to check on you.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:09.670
She said you should forfeit the next round.

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:12.180
Jenna's worried about me?

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.550
Hey, idiot!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.060
<i>There's no way.</i>

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:20.790
Mr. Leon? Are you feeling unwell after all?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:24.220
I've actually been holding it for a while.

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:25.770
I'm about to piss myself.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.070
Th-That must be quite uncomfortable.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:32.070
You should watch your language around girls.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.960
You're right. I've been off picking flowers.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.580
Not that there are flower beds in the arena.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.170
We shouldn't have worried.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.580
No.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.980
Master, Arroganz has been 
rigged with explosives.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:54.070
Your sister set them, but it was your next 
opponent who instructed her to do it.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.600
Yeah, I'm sure it was.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:16:00.830
<i>She's probably ashamed I picked 
a fight with the prince.</i>

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.560
<i>Jilk took advantage of that.</i>

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:07.830
The explosives were installed 
on the Armor's back.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:11.470
They appear to be triggered 
by a special type of magic.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:14.700
They had those explosives in the game, too.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.120
Not that I used them.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.550
If it were a standard Armor,

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:22.120
based on the quantity of explosive 
material, it would kill the pilot.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.410
If it were a standard Armor, right?

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.870
<i>Guys who seem nice are the scariest of all.</i>

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.020
<i>It's a common trope.</i>

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.770
You are strong. I respect that.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.020
Thanks.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.280
Champions, begin!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.730
It's a smokescreen.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:00.660
He can't be bothered with appearances, huh?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.670
Your life ended the moment 
you defied the prince.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:10.670
I shall at least grant you a glorious end.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.050
Is he dead?

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:18.050
What?

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:23.220
That anti-Armor bomb would 
easily pierce a standard model.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.560
It didn't leave a scratch.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.700
I have no choice. I didn't 
want to use this, but...

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:33.860
It's coming.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.440
Yeah.

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:43.580
No hard feelings. 
I'm doing this for the prince.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:48.700
Hey.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:52.250
Y-You withstood that explosion?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.840
It was a heavy blow, in more than one way.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.860
Are you determined to fight 
the prince no matter what?

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.350
Your life as a noble will be over!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.110
That's exactly what I want.

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:07.640
And I'm willing to do anything 
to achieve that, just like you!

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.110
You're going to kill the prince?!

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:14.610
Won't that be great? 
You'll have one fewer rival.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.930
Both the prince and I truly love her.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:24.860
If you intend to harm the prince, 
then I'll make your family pay for it, too!

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.880
You're threatening me?

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:31.740
Should we let the prince and 
that girl hear about this?

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:34.380
I bet they'd scorn you.

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:37.880
What proof do you have that I said that?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:45.130
<i>If you intend to harm the prince, 
then I'll make your family pay for it, too!</i>

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:51.770
Apparently outdated models come 
with a recording function.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.790
You coward!

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:59.000
Coward? Threatening your opponent because 
you're losing is far more cowardly.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.800
What's worse, you rigged 
my Armor with explosives.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.530
Isn't it your life as a noble that's over?

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.040
Silence!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.660
I'm sick of this.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.460
I've had enough. Just die.

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:34.390
Y-Your Highness, he's a dangerous man.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:38.260
You mustn't fight him.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.740
I guess I caused some trouble for my sister.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.240
Stupid Leon...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.370
Jilk...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.650
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:55.380
<i>How is there someone so strong?</i>

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.320
Will you be all right?

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.880
All four of them lost without a fight.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:03.600
<i>Jeez, he's as annoying as ever.</i>

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.680
Marie.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:10.660
It's all right. My Armor is made using 
the kingdom's greatest technology.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.850
Don't worry.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.310
Okay.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:16.360
<i>That's what they all said, 
and they were all defeated.</i>

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.360
Brad Fou Field

