Sick and tired of his current status, he falls in love with the protagonist for understanding him. 
Behaves coldly toward Angelica, who looks up to him.
As far as I'm concerned, no one can replace her. I'll show no mercy to anyone who hurts her.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:27.350
I'll be back.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:32.870
Okay. I'll pray for your 
victory, Your Highness.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.050
<i>Ugh, this is exhausting.</i>

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:43.760
<i>Imitating that optimistic 
goody-goody protagonist is rough.</i>

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:47.300
<i>But I won't let it end here.</i>

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:50.540
<i>I won't let that mob character beat me.</i>

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.880
Your Highness!

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:54.530
You can do it!

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.020
Beat that hick!

00:20:58.130 --> 00:20:59.450
How sad.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:02.940
They still expect the prince to win after 
the miserable fights they've witnessed.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.610
<i>The prince and his friends 
are still first-years.</i>

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:10.450
<i>They'll become stronger in the 
future, but right now, I'm better.</i>

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:16.990
I never thought my turn would come around.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.210
I respect how hard you've fought to get here.

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.720
Can I ask you something?

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.720
If I can answer your question, I shall.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:30.680
What do you think of the 
scholarship student, Ms. Olivia?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:35.950
Olivia? Since we've hardly spoken, 
I have no opinion on her.

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:39.230
I've heard she studies hard.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:41.490
I see.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:47.990
Champions, begin!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.490
Your Highness!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.490
You can do it!

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:28.010
Brad, Greg, Chris, Jilk...

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:29.570
Well fought, everyone.

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:32.140
Your Highness, you're the last one 
standing. How are you feeling?

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:33.480
Well? How do you feel right now?

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:34.850
Next time, "That's Awesome."

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:37.540
I shall carry the thoughts and feelings 
of the others into battle against you.

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:39.980
Based only on our dialogue, you 
sound way more like a protagonist.
